# Installed to /etc/1password/custom_allowed_browsers by juliet-kyle's
# setup-kyle-1password-browsers step (root:root, 0755).
#
# 1Password for Linux only accepts browser-extension connections from browsers
# it knows; this adds Zen (/opt/zen). 1Password checks the browser process's
# executable, which is /opt/zen/zen-bin (/opt/zen/zen is a launcher that execs
# it). Lines starting with `#` are ignored.

zen-bin
